# v1 scope

This is a short browser adventure: walk the map, talk to lords, get points once.

- Follow `docs/game-design.md`. If code and the doc disagree, stop and ask.
- Do not add combat, inventory, branching quests, extra maps, or a backend.
- Do not start scaffolding or installing until the human asks to implement.
- Placeholders for art and names are OK. Do not invent a large lore bible.
